//! W2-news-odds-llm: ports of tests/test_news.py, test_news_roles.py, test_odds.py, test_llm.py,
//! test_llm_free_only.py, plus parity goldens generated by the Python implementation:
//! RSS parsing of tests/fixtures/news/* (+ cached live feeds and crafted edge cases),
//! parse_rss_date, `classify_text` over every news item in the fixtures and a targeted corpus,
//! the LLM prompt / context text, entity grounding and odds math.
//!
//! The large fuzz corpus (20k random texts) is checked when `FM_NEWS_GOLDEN_DIR` points at the
//! output of `gen_goldens.py` (see the package report); it is skipped otherwise.

